From 463cf3ea0f031f8d0cf5e69654db47a95bc23057 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 01:25:27 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] ADD vim visual selections so terminal users can copy pane
 text

Normal-mode visual, visual-line, and block selections operate over the rendered left and right panes and yank through OSC 52. Selection anchors use rendered rows so metadata rows and reversed selections copy the highlighted text.
